// IMPORTANT (religious content policy): Quran text is loaded verbatim from Tanzil (seed-data/quran-89-114.json).
// Ayah translations, tafsir explanations and takeaways are intentionally NOT generated — they are entered by
// Hakk Academy teachers through the CMS and pass Draft → Review → Approved → Published.
// All seeded religious items are flagged is_demo=1 so the UI never shows them as "Hakk Academy тексерген".
import fs from 'node:fs';
